dhKdcB dvgRRH main-section__Header-sc-4npmlh-1 fsCwyq">About the scheme</h4=
><hr class=3D"sc-fUnMCh jVToHs main-section__HeaderDivider-sc-4npmlh-0 dtPj=
hq"><div class=3D"main-section__SectionWrapper-sc-4npmlh-4 iQrisA"><div cla=
ss=3D"styled-text-field__StyledTextFieldHtmlContainer-sc-owvj6u-2 jbPSTa"><=
div>
<div>
<div>
<p>The Baby Bonus Scheme is part of the Marriage and Parenthood Package. It=
 provides parents with financial support through the Child Development Acco=
unt (CDA) benefits and Baby Bonus Cash Gift.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<h4>Child Development Account (CDA)</h4>
<p>After your child is enrolled into the Baby Bonus Scheme, you=E2=80=99ll =
need to open a CDA with your selected bank (POSB/DBS, OCBC, or UOB). Use <a=
 href=3D"https://ask.gov.sg/msf/questions/cls1lenib011hjzsg203nmoya" target=
=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">CDA funds for approved child-related expenses<=
/a>. It=E2=80=99s a special co-savings account which will receive:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>CDA First Step Grant</strong>: one-off amount automatically dep=
osited into the CDA without you having to save first</li>
<li><strong>Government co-matching</strong>: an extra dollar for every doll=
ar that you deposit into the CDA,<br>up to the cap your child is eligible f=
or.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<h4>Child Savings Account (CSA)</h4>
<p>The CSA will be automatically opened when the CDA is opened for your chi=
ld. The CSA is a joint-savings account that allows you to conveniently rece=
ive:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Baby Bonus Cash Gift</strong>: payment deposited every 6 months=
 until the child is 6.5 years old</li>
<li>Education bursaries, grants, or awards</li>
<li>Financial assistance</li>
<li><a href=3D"https://assets.app.optical.gov.sg/lifesg/production/publishe=
d/collections/schemeDetailsPage/133/88134b1a-0621-435b-8de6-a60fb1e4d014.pn=
g?download=3D" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Excess CDA bal=
ance</a> above the Ministry of Education=E2=80=99s (MOE)<a href=3D"https://=
www.moe.gov.sg/financial-matters/psea/transfers-and-contributions" target=
=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"> Post-Secondary Education Account (=
PSEA) </a>cap, if applicable</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div><div class=3D"main-section__SectionWrapper-sc-4npmlh-4 iQ=
risA"><div class=3D"cards__CardsSectionWrapper-sc-10itmlf-3 gkiuMC"><p clas=
