ner-sc-ya70lo-7 bbVdpR"><ul>
<li style=3D"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">If your child was born in Singapore an=
d is a Singapore citizen, your Baby Bonus application will be part of your =
child=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"https://www.life.gov.sg/services/birth-registrat=
ion">birth registration</a> on LifeSG.</li>
<li style=3D"margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">If your child has already registered t=
heir birth, is a new citizen, or is adopted, apply directly through the <a =
href=3D"https://www.life.gov.sg/services/baby-bonus">Apply for Baby Bonus</=
a> service.</li>
<li>During the application, you=E2=80=99ll need to choose a bank (POSB/DBS,=
 OCBC, or UOB) to open the child=E2=80=99s CDA and CSA with.</li>
